# One line-ending rule for everyone (no LF/CRLF warnings, no mixed files):
# text is stored with LF; Windows batch and Inno Setup files are checked
# out with CRLF, which cmd.exe and the Inno compiler expect.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.iss text eol=crlf

*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.res binary
